  (descr "Kailh Choc V1 (PG1350) low profile mechanical keyboard switch, hot-swap socket and through-hole soldering, single-sided mounting. Plate cut lines: User.1=15.60mm square (cosmetic cover, all switches), User.4=13.80mm square with R0.60 corner relief (center inset 0.35) (Kailh Choc V1). Keycap: 2.00u vertical (1u wide x 2u tall, courtyard 19.00x38.05mm). No stabilizer PCB features. For Kailh Choc 1350 (V1) stabilizers use the _ChocV1Stab variant.")
